    <button type="button" class="collapsible text-orange-500 hover:font-semibold cursor-pointer transition-all">
      Perl
    </button>
    <div class="content">
      <p class="text-slate-100">
        Perl is a strange and exciting language. It is one of the best
        languages I have used for networking and system administration tools. I
        think of it as a bash orchestration language. When your program becomes
        too complex to be handled by bash, switch to Perl!
      </p>
      <br/>
      <p class="text-orange-500">Chapters:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-4">
        <li class="transition-all text-slate-100 hover:font-semibold hover:text-blue-500">
