{{#> section}}
  <div>
    <button type="button" class="collapsible text-orange-500 hover:font-semibold cursor-pointer transition-all">
      Bash
    </button>
    <div class="content">
      <p class="text-slate-100">
        Bash is the best tool for controlling Unix systems from the command
        line. It is the glue that allows you to run commands and chain programs
        together to form powerful pipelines. If you are new to Unix/Linux
        administration learning Bash should be the first thing you do!
      </p>
      <br/>
      <p class="text-orange-500">Chapters:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-4">
        <li class="transition-all text-slate-100 hover:font-semibold hover:text-blue-500">
          <a href="/note/bash/introduction">Getting Started With Bash</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
{{/section}}

